  "summary": "Completed native L04/L04b preparation on the existing ordered per-card path: compact one/all taps and captured drags, opposite-panel drop/cancel, accessible equivalents, retained-definition inspection, fixed fading actual-display feedback and non-actionable row fade/reflow. Twenty affected host cases, incremental APK/lint/boundaries, real two-normal-APK both-orientation transfer/conflict/delayed-ack/reopen/restart assertions and two focused native accessibility/animation/rapid-touch checks pass. Successful native tails reuse earlier completed UI setup/portrait assertions; retained red setup/config/scroll/observer/instrumentation-oracle outputs are diagnostics, not green runs. Read-only SQL retains 48 original IDs, one exact-copy conflict rejection without substitution, 47 accepted revisions, 48 result outbox records and the exact final 12/3 prepared copy/unchanged saved source. Sources/APKs/images/JUnit/captures and exact two-device/environment cleanup retained. Only I10b2 closes; parent audits, I11/I12 start/lifecycle, B3 independent review and final qualification/release gates remain open.",
  "selectionReason": "Clean supplied master/startCommit, active D-304 authorization, reviewed B1/B2, verified B2-R01 and implemented I09/I10a/I10b1 agree with earliest-ready I10b2; no due fix or capability review outranks it. Deliver the usable native transfer journey rather than another internal/qualification split. Affected scope is additive preparation screen/controller personal state/feedback, pointer/accessibility binding and native integration with unchanged I10b1 semantics/session/server. Targeted host/component/native checks plus incremental APK/lint suffice; rebuild the local server image only for the newly affected real native transfer seam, reusing I10b1 server tests. Test setup failures are repaired with scoped retained-state tails, not repeated green setup or full suites. No subagent, new loop, deployment, paid resource, model/permission/authorization/gate change or independent child review.",
