    "I11/I12 actual starter/Ready/start/randomness/initial table/cancel/play-sideboard exclusion and complete two-player preparation-start/lifecycle/source-isolation overlap journeys; I14 broader gameplay prediction, I28/I31 restored-preparation/rematch/integrated recovery.",
    "I32/I34 explicit reduced-motion/large-text matrix and final full suite/deferred uncommon assertions, older migration-fixture reconciliation and I09 recovered HTTP-error correction. Standard Compose motion scaling and tested native accessibility are not a newly executed reduced-motion matrix. I33 measurements, I35 compatibility/upgrade/image architecture, I36/B8 complete interface-to-mock comparison/fix/rechecks and every external release gate remain required/unverified."
